{{define "content"}}
<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-c">
    <span class="tag-live rise d1"><span class="dot"></span>B2B & wholesale</span>
    <h1 class="rise d2">Sell to businesses at the <span class="mg">same speed</span>.</h1>
    <p class="sub rise d3">Wholesale isn't a separate module: it lives inside the same store. Credit, approvals, per-customer pricing, quotes and punchout — all exact and reversible.</p>
    <div class="cta-row rise d4"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/admin/">Sign in to the panel</a><a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href="/s/qa/main/index">See a live store →</a></div>
  </div>
</header>

<section style="padding-top:14px">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="split">
      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="acct">
          <div class="acct-h"><b>Valley Hardware, Inc.</b><span class="acct-tag">B2B customer</span></div>
          <div class="acct-row"><span>Price list</span><b>Wholesale · −15%</b></div>
          <div class="acct-row"><span>Available credit</span><b>$86,000 of $150,000</b></div>
          <div class="acct-bar"><span style="width:57%"></span></div>
          <div class="acct-row"><span>Approval</span><b>2 levels · cap $20,000</b></div>
          <div class="acct-row"><span>Branches</span><b>3 · each with its budget</b></div>
          <div class="acct-foot">Requisition list “Monthly restock” · 28 lines · 1 tap</div>
        </div>
        <p class="mute" style="font-size:13px;margin-top:10px;text-align:center">Each company signs in with its code and sees its catalog, its price and its credit.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="copy reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">One account per company</p>
        <h2>Your usual terms, without a single phone call.</h2>
        <div class="sfeat" style="margin-top:22px;grid-template-columns:1fr">
          <div class="f"><span class="i">{{template "ic" "building"}}</span><div><b>Net-30 credit</b><span>A line per customer, due date and optional auto-pay.</span></div></div>
          <div class="f"><span class="i">{{template "ic" "tag"}}</span><div><b>Per-customer pricing</b><span>Lists and volume discounts; each company sees its price.</span></div></div>
          <div class="f"><span class="i">{{template "ic" "box"}}</span><div><b>Quotes & requisitions</b><span>Quote with their PO and reuse recurring-order lists.</span></div></div>
          <div class="f"><span class="i">{{template "ic" "users"}}</span><div><b>Branches & reps</b><span>Multiple branches with their budget; your team buys on their behalf.</span></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding-top:8px">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Fits how they buy</p>
      <h2>Punchout and per-company catalog, out of the box.</h2></div>
    <div class="models">
      <div class="model reveal"><span class="i">{{template "ic" "chart"}}</span><b>Punchout (cXML)</b><p>Connect your customer's procurement system and sell inside their flow.</p></div>
      <div class="model reveal"><span class="i">{{template "ic" "box"}}</span><b>Per-company catalog</b><p>Each company sees only what it can buy, with its price and terms.</p></div>
      <div class="model reveal"><span class="i">{{template "ic" "card"}}</span><b>Tiered approvals</b><p>Caps per person, levels and backups when someone is away.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding-top:8px">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band reveal">
      <div class="band-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Wholesale without friction</p>
          <h2>The company buyer serves themselves.</h2>
          <p>A self-service portal with their credit, history and lists. Fewer calls, fewer emails, more orders — with rules you define and everything on the record.</p>
          <div class="cta-row" style="margin-top:26px"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/admin/">Try it in the panel</a></div>
        </div>
        <div class="flow">
          <div class="step reveal"><span class="n">1</span><span><b>Signs in with their code</b><small>Sees their catalog and price</small></span></div>
          <div class="step reveal"><span class="n">2</span><span><b>Builds the order</b><small>From a requisition list</small></span></div>
          <div class="step reveal"><span class="n">3</span><span><b>Gets approved by level</b><small>Per each person's cap</small></span></div>
          <div class="step reveal"><span class="n">4</span><span><b>Pays on credit</b><small>Net-30, with auto-pay</small></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="close reveal" style="margin-top:46px">
      <h2>Move your wholesale to a system that doesn't slow you down.</h2>
      <div class="cta-row" style="justify-content:center;margin-top:26px"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="/en/empezar">Create my store</a><a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href="/en/giro/mayoreo">See the wholesale page →</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{{end}}
